            "title": "〈貴金屬盤後〉美7月非農爆冷 金價本周大漲逾7%創1月來最佳單周",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"〈貴金屬盤後〉美7月非農爆冷 金價本周大漲逾7%創1月來最佳單周\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"541\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/46ab27fcb3a1a9172aa9744f592abd20d9fa676ad3820cbf3be830c519bc0dda/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fcnyes_hk_559%2F0de7ade9e311a1ddf740b1a3c774f145\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">〈貴金屬盤後〉美7月非農爆冷 金價本周大漲逾7%創1月來最佳單周</figcaption></div></figure></div>",
